# Nothing here is part of the site. Vercel serves the repo root verbatim
# (outputDirectory "."), so anything not excluded becomes publicly
# downloadable at https://app.grizzlyherb.us/<path>.

# Sync + build tooling. These hold API access patterns and must never ship.
*.py
*.php
*.js.map
screenshot-*.js

# Internal docs
*.md

# Local working artefacts
.firecrawl/
figma-exports/
figma-screenshots/
reference-screenshots/
source-images/
screenshot-*.png
debug-*.png
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
nul

# NOTE: bundle-products.json and kl-review-counts.json are fetched at runtime
# by the premium-collection pages. Do NOT exclude them.
